    "description": "A small, rounded, deciduous Japanese maple, multibranched, eventually reaching about 1. 5m in height, with small 5-lobed leaves to 5cm long on short branches. The leaves emerge bright red when young, turning light green in summer then with orange and gold tints in autumn; suited to bonsai training",
